      "name": "Barb Lamont",
      "text": "Amazing work from this hard working crew. We bought a house that had heavily overgrown gardens everywhere!! Angel and his guys came through and cleared everything by hand with no heavy equipment (for the safety of my septic) in 2.5 days. Angel paid attention to detail and didn’t miss anything. He went over and above and I’m so happy we hired him. We will be using him for all our future landscaping needs. He turned our yard into a beautiful paradise.",
